<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.10.4">
<l>oṟṟai viṭaiya ṉumnāṉ mukaṉum</l>
<l rend="indent">uṉṉai yaṟiyāp perumai yōṉē</l>
<l>muṟṟa vulakellām nīyē yāki</l>
<l rend="indent">mūṉṟeḻut tāya mutalva ṉēyō</l>
<l>aṟṟatu vāṇā ḷivaṟkeṉ ṟeṇṇi</l>
<l rend="indent">añca namaṉtamar paṟṟa luṟṟa</l>
<l>aṟṟaikku nīyeṉṉaik kākka vēṇṭum</l>
<l rend="indent">araṅkat taravaṇaip paḷḷi yāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>One with [such] greatness that</l>
<l rend="indent">the one with the bull and the four-faced one do not know you.</l>
<l>O First Cause [Lord], did you not become</l>
<l rend="indent">the entirety of the world and the three letters?</l>
<l>Sleeper on the serpent bed in Araṅkam,</l>
<l rend="indent">on that day [when] Yama’s terrifying attendants</l>
<l>come and grab [me], thinking, “the life of this one is finished”,</l>
<l rend="indent">you must protect me!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
